From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yugidraft <yugidraft@localhost>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] core: immediate FFA surrender with normal chain resolution

Surrender waits for the whole open chain, including the leaver links.
Without a chain it removes the seat immediately. It preserves living
choices and only closes response windows that involve the leaving turn seat.
Other loss reasons retain their existing timing.

